    "plan": "The plan is to develop a hypothetical framework for VRAM allocation on a 12GB GPU for local LLMs. This framework will distinguish between model weights, KV cache, and other runtime memory needs. The hypothetical nature of the scenario and the lack of actual testing will be clearly stated. The post will invite discussion on adapting this framework for various hypothetical scenarios."
